  "text": "# MODULE 1: AML & SANCTIONS COMPLIANCE  \n## What Is AML?  \n**AML = Anti-Money Laundering**  \nMoney laundering is the process of converting illegally obtained money into legitimate-looking funds. AML rules are designed to prevent this.  \n**Why It Matters:**\n- FirstUK Bank must comply with UK law (Money Laundering Regulations 2017)\n- Violations result in: FCA fines (>£10M), criminal prosecution, loss of license\n- Your role: Identify and report suspicious activity",
